    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Are you struggling with SEO issues caused by outdated or incorrect hentry and hatom microformats on your WordPress website?</p>\n<p>Our plugin provides an easy, automated solution to remove hentry and hatom microformats, ensuring your site is clean, optimized, and SEO-friendly.</p>\n<p>See more in documentation via <a href=\"https://shieldclimb.com/free-woocommerce-plugins/remove-hentry-and-hatom/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">this website</a>.</p>\n<p>📺 <strong>Watch the full install and setup tutorial here:</strong><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M5FViB8EexQ?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download our plugin from https://shieldclimb.com/free-woocommerce-plugins/remove-hentry-and-hatom/</li>\n<li>At your WordPress admin, Go to Plugins &gt; Add New Plugin &gt; Upload Plugin &gt; Choose File (Choose the file you downloaded just now) &gt; Click Install</li>\n<li>Click Activate to automatically start remove hentry and hatom microformats.</li>\n<li>Enjoy an SEO-optimized, faster WordPress website free from unnecessary markup.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>📺 <strong>Watch the full install and setup tutorial here:</strong><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M5FViB8EexQ?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20are%20hentry%20and%20hatom%20microformats%2C%20and%20why%20should%20i%20remove%20them%3F'>\nWhat are hentry and hatom microformats, and why should I remove them?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Hentry and hatom are outdated microformats that were once used to help search engines understand web content. However, they’re no longer recommended and can trigger SEO warnings. Removing them helps keep your site up to modern standards.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='will%20this%20plugin%20affect%20my%20site%E2%80%99s%20seo%20rankings%3F'>\nWill this plugin affect my site’s SEO rankings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, by removing outdated microformats like hentry and hatom, the plugin ensures your site is aligned with modern SEO standards, improving your search engine visibility.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='do%20i%20need%20to%20configure%20anything%20after%20installation%3F'>\nDo I need to configure anything after installation?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Nope. Just install, activate, and you’re good to go. It’s a plug-and-play solution — everything happens in the background.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
